 "title": {
  "zh": "装置电磁线性模型导出：**零等离子体极限是纯电路的解析本征值，导出的 γ 与竖直稳定性门逐位同值**",
  "en": "The device's linear electromagnetic model: the zero-plasma limit is the bare circuit's analytic spectrum, and the exported γ equals the vertical-stability door's"
 },
