  "type": "spo:Code",
  "name": "fylite · `fylite.scenario.control.lti`（`linear_model` · `from_vertical_system` · `to_em_coupling`）",
  "comment": "2026-09-18 新写：由 `code/vstab` 那扇门给的电感、电阻、耦合梯度与磁诊断行装配 (A, B, C, D)；等离子体响应「静止 / 刚性位移」由参数选，摄动 G-S 按名拒绝"
 },
 "compared_reference": [
  {
   "type": "spo:InformationContentEntity",
   "name": "纯电路的解析本征值；单回路刚性色散根；FR-EQ-016 竖直稳定性门的 γ",
   "comment": "两回路 det(λM + R) = 0 的闭式根；单回路 γ = kR/(I_p²G² − kL)；EAST #137985 上 `code/vstab` 的开环 γ。"
  }
 ],
 "criteria": [
  {
   "id": "benchmark/records/mhd-vertical-lti-export/criterion/1",
   "type": "fyo:AcceptanceCriterion",
   "quantity_label": "零等离子体极限下 $\\mathbf A=-\\mathbf M^{-1}\\mathbf R$ 与纯电路解析特征值一致",
   "norm": "identity",
   "tolerance_basis": "machine_precision"
  },
  {
   "id": "benchmark/records/mhd-vertical-lti-export/criterion/2",
   "type": "fyo:AcceptanceCriterion",
   "quantity_label": "γ 读数随导出出",
   "norm": "identity",
   "tolerance_basis": "machine_precision"
  },
  {
   "id": "benchmark/records/mhd-vertical-lti-export/criterion/3",
